<title>USA: Security Capital sets meeting record date.</title>
<headline>Security Capital sets meeting record date.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Capital Pacific Trust said Friday that its board of trustees has set August 6, 1997 as the record date for voting on the previously announced proposal to become an internally managed REIT and for participation in a rights offering of up to $143.9 million of common shares of beneficial interest.</p>
<p>A special meeting of shareholders has been scheduled for Monday, September 8, 1997 at which a shareholder vote on the proposal will be taken.</p>
